  "generatedAt": "2026-10-01T03:03:13.107Z",
  "title": "osf changeset tests: parse-based Rust test summary in the status block",
  "summary": "The `osf` CLI is regrouped: `osf risk` becomes `osf changeset risk`, `osf status` becomes `osf pr status`, and a new `osf changeset tests` command joins them. The new module parses the base and head versions of every changed `.rs` file with tree-sitter, diffs the tests it finds by module path plus function name, and renders an added/changed/removed summary. `osf pr status refresh` now calls that summary and threads it into the status block between Approach and the end marker, and a refresh on a description with no block now starts one with a placeholder instead of doing nothing.",
  "lenses": [
    "architecture",
    "data-flow"
  ],
